-`bash "$SD/scripts/codex-probe.sh" --config "$CFG" --repo-root "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR"` and parse
-`{codexReviewAvailable, codexReviewBin, codexReviewVersion, reason}` (`reason` ∈
